  },
  "body": "Facts about the [SVG Tiny 1.2 spec](https://www.w3.org/TR/SVGTiny12/) (Recommendation):\n- last published/updated in 2008\n- last time [anything was added to the errata for it](https://www.w3.org/2008/12/REC-SVGTiny12-20081222-errata.html) was 2009\n- has never been an accurate reflection of what SVG features are implemented in browsers\n\nFacts about the [SVG 1.1 spec](https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/) (also a Recommendation):\n- last published in 2011\n- last time [anything was added to the errata for it](https://www.w3.org/2011/08/REC-SVG11-20110816-errata) was 2014\n- the more accurate (vs Tiny 1.2) documentation of SVG features that browsers actually implement\n",
